For any finite class $\calL$, there exists a generation algorithm that uniformly generates from $\calL$ and guarantees that for any target $L^* \in \calL$ and adversarial sequence consistent with $L^*$:
    \begin{enumerate}
        \item The total number of mistakes is at most $\min\{\lfloor \log_2 |\calL|\rfloor, \mathsf{Cdim}(\calL)\}$.
        \item The time of last mistake is at most $\mathsf{Cdim}(\calL)$.
    \end{enumerate}
